WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.840
In one particularly exciting cross test, the
Foundation set SCP-682, the infamous Hard

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:11.520
to Destroy Reptile, against SCP-204, a cloud
of deadly, all-consuming nanites bonded to

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.160
a small child for the purposes of protecting
them.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:19.440
As SCP-682 naturally attacked the child, the
nanites sprung into action, forming the shape

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.840
of a huge warrior with an axe and shield.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:27.280
The battle was intense, but amazingly, despite
taking tremendous damage itself, the SCP-204

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:30.240
warrior kicked the stuffing out of SCP-682.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:36.560
As is expected of SCP-204, its nanites began
feeding on SCP-682’s immobilized body.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:40.080
But, surprise surprise,&nbsp;
SCP-682 started regenerating&nbsp;

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.760
faster than the nanites could eat it.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:45.200
It then began to attack SCP-204 once again.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:50.160
The Foundation tranquilized both parties,
and hosed SCP-682 with hydrochloric acid,

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.400
before returning them both to their chambers.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.000
All anomalies contained.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.360
No children harmed.

